            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Fay Crisanto"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I am grateful for these quick and easy one-pot recipes. I used olive oil instead of butter, turkey bacon instead of pork bacon, and non-dairy coffee creamer instead of milk or half and half. I also added lemon juice, hot sauce, Worcestershire sauce, and oregano to the recipe. It was a really easy dish to make, and it turned out so delicious. I will be making creamed spinach this way from now on."
          },
